n_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體或未核定跨卷身份與指代；不補造個人與世代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"費昌","kind":"person","person_id":"fkx_pbx_7kt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體或未核定跨卷身份與指代；不補造個人與世代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"費昌","kind":"person","person_id":"fkx_pbx_7kt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"夏桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"65f_dvi_ljt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"大廉","kind":"person","person_id":"u39_e0i_cta","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"孟戲","kind":"person","person_id":"g9x_uoh_p49","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"中衍","kind":"person","person_id":"ie6_nw9_g32","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0085","start":85,"end":88,"surface":"帝太戊","kind":"person","person_id":"ta6_n0m_glj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"太戊","kind":"person","person_id":"ta6_n0m_glj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m002-0111","start":111,"end":113,"surface":"中衍","kind":"person","person_id":"ie6_nw9_g32","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p009","text":"周公歸，恐成王壯，治有所淫佚，乃作多士，作毋逸。毋逸稱：『爲人父母，爲業至長久，子孫驕奢忘之，以亡其家，爲人子可不慎乎！筆昔在殷王中宗，嚴恭敬畏天命，自度治民，震懼不敢荒寧，故中宗饗國七十五年。其在髙宗，久勞于外，爲與小人，作其即位，乃有亮闇，三年不言，言乃讙，不敢荒寧，密靖殷國，至于小大無怨，故髙宗饗國五十五年。其在祖甲，不義惟王，久爲小人于外，知小人之依，能保施小民，不侮寡，故祖甲饗國三十三年。』多士稱曰：『自湯至于帝乙，無不率祀明德，帝無不配天者。在今後嗣王紂，誕淫厥佚，不顧天及民之從也。其民皆可誅。』『文王日中昃不暇食，饗國五十年。』作此以誡成王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"父母","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未定稱謂，少昊傳說稱呼未另核；不補姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"子孫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或未定稱謂，少昊傳說稱呼未另核；不補姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0063","start":63,"end":67,"surface":"殷王中宗","kind":"person","person_id":"ta6_n0m_glj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"中宗","kind":"person","person_id":"ta6_n0m_glj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"髙宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"髙宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cld_aan_e20","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0160","start":160,"end":162,"surface":"祖甲","kind":"person","person_id":"kfj_bhr_cdz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0192","start":192,"end":194,"surface":"祖甲","kind":"person","person_id":"kfj_bhr_cdz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m009-0209","start":209,"end":210,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"tpz_x3m_e0h","status":"contextual_pr